{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5057301","formula":"C₂₀H₂₂N₈O₆S₂","hill":"C20H22N8O6S2","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"H":22.0,"N":8.0,"O":6.0,"S":2.0},"names":{"en":"Ceftobiprole","ru":"Цефтобипрол","uk":"Цефтобіпрол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Ceftobiprole, sold under the brand name Zevtera among others, is a fifth-generation cephalosporin antibacterial used for the treatment of hospital-acquired pneumonia (excluding ventilator-associated pneumonia) and community-acquired pneumonia. It is marketed by Basilea Pharmaceutica under the brand names Zevtera and Mabelio. Like other cephalosporins, ceftobiprole exerts its antibacterial activity by binding to important penicillin-binding proteins and inhibiting their transpeptidase activity which is essential for the synthesis of bacterial cell walls.","ru":"Цефтобипрол — лекарственное средство, полусинтетический антибиотик группы цефалоспоринов V поколения, широкого спектра действия, для парентерального введения.","uk":"Цефтобіпрол — перший антибіотик з групи цефалоспоринів V покоління. Застосовується як перорально так і парентерально."},"fame":16,"pubchemCid":135413542,"mass":534.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CNC[C@@H]1N2CC/C(=C\\C3=C(N4[C@@H]([C@@H](C4=O)NC(=O)/C(=N\\O)/C5=NSC(=N5)N)SC3)C(=O)O)/C2=O","inchikey":"VOAZJEPQLGBXGO-SDAWRPRTSA-N","iupac":"(6R,7R)-7-[[(2Z)-2-(5-amino-1,2,4-thiadiazol-3-yl)-2-hydroxyiminoacetyl]amino]-8-oxo-3-[(E)-[2-oxo-1-[(3R)-pyrrolidin-3-yl]pyrrolidin-3-ylidene]methyl]-5-thia-1-azabicyclo[4.2.0]oct-2-ene-2-carboxylic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"135413542","atoms":58,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":5.481,"y":2.886,"z":-2.258,"el":"C"},{"x":5.201,"y":2.627,"z":-3.726,"el":"C"},{"x":5.816,"y":1.324,"z":-3.956,"el":"N"},{"x":5.48